meta {
  name: Get Status
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/:id/status
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: your-server-id
}

docs {
  Current runtime status reported by the machine-agent (players, uptime, version, RCON). When the agent observes repeated container restarts without an RCON response, the response includes health: "DEGRADED", healthMessage, restartCount and lastRestartAt.
}
